Description:It is your first main phase. You control Marisi's Twinclaws, a Forest and a Mountain, and have Giant Growth in hand. The opponent is at 4 life and controls Ghostly Prison and a tapped Archetype of Courage. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-e3bb461ba8ca6271 | Double strike is a different ability from first strike (CR 702.4a, 702.7a): Archetype of Courage removes first strike, not double strike, so Marisi's Twinclaws still deals combat damage twice; pay Ghostly Prison's {2} and attack for 4
